# Telos, the old military base (TSL, 232TEL), as far as the reactor: Bao-
# Dur's fist through the force fields, the turrets and the base's droids,
# the security control (the poison grates off), his Security on the
# security doors, the reactor started (its turrets turn hostile); the
# Exile fights the droids, Bao-Dur leads only to strike and unlock (the
# rest: telos_base_shuttle). Starts from the Czerka site's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_military_base data/routes/tsl/telos_military_base.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Old Military Base" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
gather               # the party together, then to the first force field
use TelosDoorFirst   # for Bao-Dur's fist (he must stand within 10 m: a
talk                 # press before he is near only finds it locked)
use TurretA1         # the four turrets beyond, shot down (DSimpson: XP
use TurretA2         # for the fight, none for the console)
use TurretA3
say Slice into security terminal # the fourth, out of the room's sight,
say Deactivate local turrets # turned off at the room's console ([Computer])
use TermSA
talk
fight 30             # the droids at the next force field, fought by the
leader 1             # Exile; then Bao-Dur strikes it himself (DSimpson:
bash TelosDoor2@8    # switch to Bao-Dur; a_ffield_baodur opens it to his
leader player        # blow)
save telos_base_halls
fight 30             # the droids in the hall and the side passages
leader 1             # Bao-Dur's blow on each force field, the Exile leading
bash TelosDoor2@5    # the fights beyond: the turrets' room's, its six
leader player        # droids and turrets fought (the workbench beside),
fight 30             # the shuttle hangar's, and down the lower passage the
leader 1             # one to the left
bash TelosDoor2@6
leader player
fight 30
leader 1
bash TelosDoor2@7
leader player
fight 30
say Turn off the security gas vents # the security control: the poison
use Security         # grates off
talk
save telos_base_security
leader 1             # to the reactor: Bao-Dur's Security on the security
unlock TelosDoor3@1  # doors (DC 28), his blow on the force fields, the
leader player        # droids on the way fought by the Exile
fight 30
say Who are you?     # the Czerka salvager hiding past the next doors
say Follow me out    # (DSimpson's escort): led back to the base's
to tr_salvage        # entrance, where he waits for the next freighter
talk                 # (LSP); then back to the reactor's way
fight 30             # the droids come at his voice
to tr_czerka_escape  # his thanks as he reaches it (a one-line talk, LSP),
gone Salvage         # and he leaves
leader 1
bash TelosDoor2@2
leader player
fight 30
leader 1
unlock TelosDoor3@2
leader player
fight 30
leader 1
unlock TelosDoor3@4
leader player
fight 30
leader 1
bash TelosDoor2@1
leader player
fight 30
leader 1
bash TelosDoor2@4
leader player
fight 30
leader 1
bash TelosDoor2@3
leader player
use Reactor          # the reactor started: its turrets turn hostile
talk
fight 30
save telos_reactor
